[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Photopea (محرر صور مجاني)
Name[ar]=فوتوبيا (بديل فوتوشوب مجاني)
Comment=Free Photoshop-compatible editor in the browser, opens PSD files
Exec=exo-open --launch WebBrowser https://www.photopea.com/
Icon=applications-graphics
Categories=Graphics;
StartupNotify=true
